Route117_Text_H0::
    .string "Look at them. Every one of these\n"
    .string "I put in myself.\p"
    .string "The day care pays me in seed.$"

Route117_Text_H1::
    .string "The air's nice here!\p"
    .string "Mum says that's why the DAY CARE\n"
    .string "is on this road.$"

Route117_Text_H2_0::
    .string "I'm halfway through a triathlon\n"
    .string "and I'd rather do this.$"

Route117_Text_H2_1::
    .string "Out of everything at once.$"

Route117_Text_H2_2::
    .string "I've dropped to last, haven't I.\p"
    .string "Worth it.$"

Route117_Text_H3_0::
    .string "Let me see whether you've raised\n"
    .string "them or merely fed them.$"

Route117_Text_H3_1::
    .string "Raised. I concede it.$"

Route117_Text_H3_2::
    .string "Feeding is not raising.\p"
    .string "Watch what each one is like and\n"
    .string "train the animal you actually have.$"

Route117_Text_H4_0::
    .string "Would you battle the ones I'm\n"
    .string "raising? They need a real one.$"

Route117_Text_H4_1::
    .string "Yours have been brought up\n"
    .string "properly.$"

Route117_Text_H4_2::
    .string "It isn't all power.\p"
    .string "Take the one odd thing a POKéMON\n"
    .string "does well and make it the best\l"
    .string "in the region. That's a life too.$"

Route117_Text_H5_0::
    .string "I train for the triathlon with my\n"
    .string "POKéMON. I'll back my legs against\l"
    .string "anyone's.$"

Route117_Text_H5_1::
    .string "More practice needed, then.$"

Route117_Text_H5_2::
    .string "Training counts only if you keep\n"
    .string "at it.\p"
    .string "So I'll start again. Tomorrow.$"

Route117_Text_H6_0::
    .string "BUG CATCHER once, BUG MANIAC now.\p"
    .string "Same feeling, longer word.$"

Route117_Text_H6_1::
    .string "Same uselessness as well.$"

Route117_Text_H6_2::
    .string "I followed the one thing I liked\n"
    .string "and they gave me a title for it.\p"
    .string "I'd have done it without the\n"
    .string "title.$"

Route117_Text_H7_0::
    .string "MEG: I'm tagging with my senior.\n"
    .string "You're in trouble now.$"

Route117_Text_H7_1::
    .string "MEG: Sorry, ANNA. That was me.$"

Route117_Text_H7_2::
    .string "MEG: I pulled her down with me.\p"
    .string "On her own she'd have had you.$"

Route117_Text_H8_0::
    .string "ANNA: I've got my junior with me,\n"
    .string "so I'd better be good.$"

Route117_Text_H8_1::
    .string "ANNA: Ah. Both of us, then.$"

Route117_Text_H8_2::
    .string "ANNA: Your two work well together.\p"
    .string "Second best on this road. I'm not\n"
    .string "giving up first.$"

Route117_Text_H9::
    .string "I left mine at the DAY CARE and it\n"
    .string "came back knowing a move I never\l"
    .string "taught it.\p"
    .string "They swear they didn't. I believe\n"
    .string "them, which is worse.$"

Route117_Text_H10_0::
    .string "Let me show you what a PSYCHIC\n"
    .string "type keeps behind its eyes.$"

Route117_Text_H10_1::
    .string "Astonishing.$"

Route117_Text_H10_2::
    .string "PSYCHIC types are difficult.\p"
    .string "Catch one anyway. Difficult is\n"
    .string "not the same as bad.$"

Route117_Text_H11_0::
    .string "Win first. Feel about it after.\p"
    .string "That's the order.$"

Route117_Text_H11_1::
    .string "I won't sulk over it. I'll train.$"

Route117_Text_H11_2::
    .string "Worry about losing and you have\n"
    .string "already begun to lose.$"

Route117_Text_H12_0::
    .string "Isn't this better? Battling with\n"
    .string "the flowers out?$"

Route117_Text_H12_1::
    .string "Oh, that was good.$"

Route117_Text_H12_2::
    .string "A jog along this road with the\n"
    .string "beds in bloom sets a person up\l"
    .string "for the week.$"

Route117_Text_H13::
    .string "ROUTE 117\n"
    .string "{LEFT_ARROW} VERDANTURF TOWN$"

Route117_Text_H14::
    .string "ROUTE 117\n"
    .string "{RIGHT_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY$"

Route117_Text_H15::
    .string "POKéMON DAY CARE\p"
    .string "“Leave two. Come back later.\n"
    .string "No promises about what you get.”$"
